        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Starting with the block</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">A small group mapped one everyday obstacle: a shared courtyard that was hot, underused and difficult to maintain.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">The story is fictional and demonstrates the layout.</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: ae837f912999e2767f98a3334270701874aa29e70a35de3f69944d495060305d
  - elementId: slide-7-node-126-story-column-1
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 641
      - 180
      - 135
      - 319
    content:
      fontFamily: Arial
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: '#FFFFFF'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Testing one change</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Residents and volunteers built a shade-and-planting trial, then observed how people used the space across two weeks.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Replace this copy with an approved case study.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 507840bf3c42bd04b085ecaf6ec58f62321e3d5ba3be8682740569982317187d
  - elementId: slide-7-node-127-story-column-2
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 794
      - 180
      - 135
      - 319
    content:
      fontFamily: Arial
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: '#FFFFFF'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Learning in public</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">The team shared what worked, what failed and what would change before the next round.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11.5px;font-family:Arial">Use evidence that readers can verify.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: c4dcb5c50f4f22f3f1b5ef06af2372f2698e1b41bac28b4f90e4ec3e0c6e8d78
